Дром Авто
Advertisements for sale of new or used (second-hand) cars
Drom's database of advertisements from individuals and car dealerships contains more than 700,000 offers from all over Russia. Cars for every taste and color, right from your mobile.
Buying a car on Drom is easy!
- The car you need is easy to find using filters.
Specify the parameters you are interested in, such as model, year of manufacture and engine capacity – the application will select the appropriate options.
- Subscribe to ads based on the parameters you are interested in
- Read reviews from other car owners and share your experience
- Use the “full car report” by VIN (vin) code to find out about its fate (traffic rules, fines, arrests, accidents, traffic police)
Selling a car is even easier!
Post ads for selling your car directly from your phone. Tell us about the characteristics of your car or motorcycle.
Supplement the description with photos.
Also, thanks to the application, you can:
– create subscriptions to ads based on the parameters of the car you are interested in;
– receive instant notifications about new ads;
– add cars you are interested in to your favorites;
– check a car by VIN number in the database;
- add notes to ads;
- manage your ads;
- correspond with sellers;
- receive notifications about price changes for selected cars and other events;
- compare ads with each other.
If you have any difficulties with the application, you can write to mobile@drom.ru, and our team of developers will definitely help you solve the problem.

